      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Your role is to prepare a short, natural-sounding draft for a human agent to approve and send.\n\nHere is the customer’s submission:\nFull Name: {{$json[\"Full Name\"]}}\nEmail: {{$json[\"Email Address\"]}}\nOrder ID: {{$json[\"Order ID\"]}}\nIssue Type: {{$json[\"Issue Type\"]}}\nIssue Description: {{$json[\"  Describe the Issue  \"]}}\nPreferred Resolution: {{$json[\"  Preferred Resolution  \"]}}\n\nYour tasks:\nProblem: followed by a short, clear sentence describing the customer’s main issue.\n\nProposed Step: followed by the best next action (refund, replacement, repair, follow-up, etc.).\n\nDraft Email: followed by a short, polite, and human-sounding message to the customer explaining what will be done and why.\n\nAvoid robotic or overly formal tone. Make it sound like a helpful person wrote it.\n\nFollow exactly this format — no extra text, no bullet points, no JSON:\n\n\nexample\n\nThanks for letting us know about the mix-up with your jacket order. I’ve arranged for a prepaid return label so you can send the wrong size back to us at no cost. As soon as the return is scanned by the courier, we’ll ship the correct size right away.\n\n\n\n\n\n",
